			(property "Description" "Power Jack Connector This is the standard 5.5mm barrel jack for power.\nThe PTH is the most common, proven, reliable, footprint.\nThe Slot footprint only works if the mill layer is transmitted to the PCB fab house so be warned.\n\nHere are the connectors we sell at SparkFun:\n\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/119 DC Barrel Power Jack/Connector (PRT-00119)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/12748 DC Barrel Power Jack/Connector (SMD) (PRT-12748)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10811 DC Barrel Jack Adapter - Breadboard Compatible (PRT-10811)\n\nIt is used on this SparkFun product (and many, many others):\n\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/12757 SparkFun RedBoard - Programmed with Arduino (DEV-12757)\n\nAlso, if you need a mating power supply or connector, please check these out:\n\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/298 Wall Adapter Power Supply - 9VDC 650mA (TOL-00298)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10287 DC Barrel Jack Adapter - Male (PRT-10287)"
				(at 0 0 0)
